$1.2 billion

71
00:10:51,095 --> 00:11:01,695
That's the valuation XDOF is said to command in a new Series B round, led by 8VC — just three months after the robotics data startup left stealth mode .

72
00:11:01,695 --> 00:11:11,858
The previous Series A in June 2026 raised $70M with participation from Thrive Capital, Andreessen Horowitz, Lux, and Spark Capital .

73
00:11:11,858 --> 00:11:23,158
XDOF already has annualized revenue of nearly $50M across 20 customers, including several frontier AI labs, and developed the GELLO teleoperation system .

74
00:11:23,158 --> 00:11:34,058
Compared to classic startup timelines, where a tenfold valuation jump typically takes years, this is an extreme acceleration pace for the robotics/AI-data sector.

